[I] Fast network logon cracker with support for many different services

[T] THC Hydra is a parallelized network login cracker that supports many
[T] protocols, such as SSH, FTP, HTTP, IMAP, SMB, RDP and databases. It is
[T] intended for security researchers and penetration testers to test
[T] password strength.

[U] https://github.com/vanhauser-thc/thc-hydra

